{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1497070-escape-from-hunedoara-castle","id":1497070,"title":"Escape from Hunedoara Castle","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-11-13T22:40:54-08:00","id":1497070,"title":"Escape from Hunedoara Castle","content":"If you want to free the council of twelve from the pact how would you do that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3792-trueann","name":"trueann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3792_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"167"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T03:02:22-08:00","id":1497082,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>trueann</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1497070-escape-from-hunedoara-castle#post1497070\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you want to free the council of twelve from the pact how would you do that?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It has been more than a decade since i last read Lair of the Hidden, but for most of them it's about getting their crap together, stop making excuses to justify the secret sacrifices to hide the castle, then sincerely go back to the road of rebuilding their Huanity and seeking Golconda instead of just going through the motions, no?<br /> <br /> Maybe not exaclty in that order, but it's mostly about revoking the deal and stop with the regular sacrifices to the demon behind the pact, if memory tricks me not.<br /> <br /> From that perspective, one might say the real antagonist in the tale is not <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Nikanuuranu\" target=\"_blank\">Nikanuuranu</a> but <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Cretheus\" target=\"_blank\">Cret</a>, who smooth-talked them all in taking this immensely questionable deal in the first place and has kept coming up with additional justifications not to cancel it, <b>centuries </b>after it has backfired badly, eroding on the morality of them all.<br /> <br /> <br /> That said, annulling the pact now might expose the existence of the castle to any potential observers mundane or supernatural, what beside a potentially big Masquerade breach could bring the attention of at least the Tremere (due to its closeness to Ceoris) and any Tzimisce elders or other ancients with a stake in the region, but except for <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Danika_Ruthven\" target=\"_blank\">Danika</a> i dare say everybody would be better off without it anyway.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 11-14-2022, 07:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-23T16:40:11-08:00","id":1497954,"title":"","content":"You get Saulot to deal with the earthbound...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24992-haquim","name":"Haquim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-03T10:17:39-08:00","id":1498686,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Haquim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1497070-escape-from-hunedoara-castle?p=1497954#post1497954\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You get Saulot to deal with the earthbound...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yes, pretty much the book mentions that Saulot could with a single gesture banish the demon and end the pact without breaking a sweat, something that gives further credit to the allegations that antediluvians are a whole league above demons in terms of power on the physical realm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12348-herr-meister","name":"Herr Meister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1114"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}